                                        "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003EHigher Education\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Ch1\u003EEmory University - AAE\u003C\/h1\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA full rebuild of a university website paired with a migration of its e-commerce system to Shopify. The goal was to eliminate outdated workflows, improve performance, and unify content and commerce into a seamless user experience.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca class=\u0022button transparent\u0022 href=\u0022https:\/\/together.emory.edu\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 tabindex=\u00220\u0022\u003EView Website\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
