                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003ECase Study\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EChallenge\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003EI inherited a templated website built on an outdated Drupal 9 architecture that combined both content and e-commerce into a single system. The site suffered from significant performance issues, slow load times, and lacked scalability. Although React had been layered in to improve speed, the underlying structure wasn\u2019t designed to support modern performance or growth.\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
