                                        "id": "152",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003ESolution\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EDecoupling \u0026amp; Rebuild\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo stabilize and modernize the platform, I led a foundational restructuring:\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e446628371ffc5bf38292473425a99eb3\u0022\u003ESeparated e-commerce from the main website, migrating all transactional functionality to Shopify\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e713152389340a21aecee11a13bfe765b\u0022\u003ERebuilt the website on Drupal 11, establishing a scalable, future-ready CMS\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e8f30d3b9f4ad8080011e6aa68050e419\u0022\u003ERedesigned the content architecture, introducing structured content types such as Person, Event, Article, Trip, and Vlog\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022e4f37df884dc0c72ae9621f3b39c4e8b0\u0022\u003EImplemented lazy loading across all media, significantly improving perceived performance\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-list-item-id=\u0022efcded48e80db95b83e9d240e632300a0\u0022\u003ERemoved unnecessary complexity, eliminating reliance on React for performance fixes and instead solving issues at the architectural level\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\n"
