                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022subhead color-accent\u0022\u003ESuccess\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022h3\u0022\u003EImpact\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003EBy decoupling the systems and rebuilding with a focus on scalability and performance, the platform transformed from a slow, rigid experience into a fast, maintainable ecosystem. The marketing site became more flexible and content-driven, while the e-commerce experience gained reliability and performance through Shopify.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022text-align-center\u0022\u003EThis separation allowed each platform to excel in its role\u2014resulting in a cleaner user experience, faster load times, and a foundation built for long-term growth.\u003C\/p\u003E\n"
